{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1625.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"bcfe13d721a7b3d2116d62b12a90cfc8900b05b946411f974864d72d6c31158e","ja":"大丈夫だよ、つむりん！\nこんなこともあるかと思って、用意しておいたからっ！","zh":"没关系的，小紬紬！\n我就想着可能会遇到这种情况，所以早就准备好啦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1625.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"12afe375053332fc7a58ac3989617e52040f3e85d90d9039c4e77c8d57491069","ja":"じゃじゃーん！　うみみん特製・経口補水液～☆\nよかったらこのタオルも、汗をふくのに使ってね！","zh":"当当当——！海美美特制·口服补液盐～☆\n不介意的话，这条毛巾也拿去擦汗吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1625.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"b9d04517a8e02ba192752a305a6848d8bd4f04107af663200fd56fbe85b5f458","ja":"あの、とてもありがたいのですが、\nそれでは、高坂さんの分がなくなってしまうのでは？","zh":"那个，虽然非常感激，\n但这样一来，高坂同学的不就没了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1625.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"674db3b65491c8841ff70a4457c11eed7612423929ff66f70a7cd680751fcefa","ja":"心配しないで！\n私の分も、ちゃんとあるから！","zh":"别担心！\n我自己的这份也好好准备了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1625.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"1d834565cafeb2965106ad88fbd19ac8cd72c4a081d2925317a628ca4b082d79","ja":"そうですか……では、遠慮なく。\nありがとうございます、高坂さん。","zh":"这样啊……那我就不客气了。\n非常感谢你，高坂同学。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1625.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"b3267d7fb743a43d1818290445ceb7a7569fb55b359faf22005dd68be6b2081d","ja":"どういたしまして♪\nそれじゃあ、そろそろ移動しよっか！","zh":"不客气♪\n那么，我们也差不多该出发了吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
